                '  when the price is weak, or pay has to move to cash.', \
                '', \
                '**What a rank does not prove.** A rank measures a pattern. It is not a finding about any one company\'s purpose, and not', \
                'a forecast that its shares will fall. 0 of the 5 had meaningful owner cash in their latest 12 months, and 1 are capital-led: their', \
                'shortfall is mostly investment. Each company page lists what cuts the other way.', \
                '', \
                '## The index' \
            ] \
        ], \
        [ \
            'markdownPrint', \
            [ \
                '', \
                '**Show:** [Stock pay \\(5\\)](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'latest\') | [Thin margin \\(1\\)](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'latest\'&var.vType=\'thin_margin\') | [Cash burner \\(1\\)](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'latest\'&var.vType=\'cash_burner\') | [Cash generative \\(1\\)](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'latest\'&var.vType=\'cash_generative\') | [Excluded industry \\(1\\)](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'latest\'&var.vType=\'excluded\') | All (9) \\\n**Sort:** [Rank](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vType=\'all\') | [P1](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'p1\'&var.vType=\'all\') | [Cumulative margin](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'cum\'&var.vType=\'all\') | Latest margin | [Stock pay](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'pay\'&var.vType=\'all\') | [Revenue](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'revenue\'&var.vType=\'all\') | [Name](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSic=7372&var.vSort=\'name\'&var.vType=\'all\') \\\n**Industry:** SIC code 7372 ([all industries](#var.vFind=\'CO\'&var.vSort=\'latest\'&var.vType=\'all\'))', \
