                '', \
                'The index ranks how outside owners have been treated. It is not a short list, a price forecast or investment advice,', \
                'and it makes no finding about any one company\'s intent.' \
            ] \
        ] \
    ])
endfunction
unittestRunTest('testMain_companyNoCostLine')


# Unranked with a score, former names, a share count change, cash returned
