                    '| Stock pay is the cause: least stock pay, as a share of revenue | 2.0% | 2.0% | [a fifth lower](#var.vPage=\'explore\'&var.vSbcRevenue=0.016) \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vPage=\'explore\'&var.vSbcRevenue=0.024) |', \
                    '| Stock pay is the cause: least stock pay, as a share of free cash flow | 50.0% | 50.0% | [a fifth lower](#var.vPage=\'explore\'&var.vSbcFcf=0.4) \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vPage=\'explore\'&var.vSbcFcf=0.6) |', \
                    '| P1: cumulative owner-cash margin that scores 0 | 5.0% | 5.0% | [a fifth lower](#var.vCumZero=0.04&var.vPage=\'explore\') \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vCumZero=0.06&var.vPage=\'explore\') |', \
                    '| P1: cumulative owner-cash margin that scores 8 | -10.0% | -10.0% | [a fifth lower](#var.vCumFull=-0.08&var.vPage=\'explore\') \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vCumFull=-0.12&var.vPage=\'explore\') |', \
                    '| P1: latest owner-cash margin that scores 0 | 5.0% | 5.0% | [a fifth lower](#var.vLatestZero=0.04&var.vPage=\'explore\') \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vLatestZero=0.06&var.vPage=\'explore\') |', \
                    '| P1: latest owner-cash margin that scores 7 | -5.0% | -5.0% | [a fifth lower](#var.vLatestFull=-0.04&var.vPage=\'explore\') \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vLatestFull=-0.06&var.vPage=\'explore\') |', \
                    '| P2b: fall in the cost ratio, in points of revenue, that scores 0 | 10 | 10 | [a fifth lower](#var.vDrop=8&var.vPage=\'explore\') \\| definition \\| [a fifth higher](#var.vDrop=12&var.vPage=\'explore\') |' \
                ], \
                '', \
                '## The top 25 at these thresholds', \
                '', \
                '4 companies pass the screen and are ranked at these thresholds; 4 are in the published index.', \
                '', \
                [ \
                    '| Rank here | Published rank | Company | Screen score here | Published screen score | P1 here | P2b here |', \
                    '| --: | --: | :-- | --: | --: | --: | --: |', \
                    '| 1 | 1 | [One\\-Off Co](#var.vCik=6&var.vPage=\'company\') | 42.2 | 42.2 | 21.1 | 13.0 |', \
                    '| 2 | 2 | [Stock Pay Co](#var.vCik=1&var.vPage=\'company\') | 37.3 | 37.3 | 18.6 | 13.0 |', \
                    '| 3 | 3 | [Capital & Sons \\[Holdings\\]](#var.vCik=2&var.vPage=\'company\') | 32.6 | 32.6 | 18.6 | 9.8 |', \
                    '| 4 | 4 | [Marginal Co](#var.vCik=10&var.vPage=\'company\') | 25.9 | 25.9 | 13.0 | 13.0 |' \
                ], \
                '', \
                'Scores here are computed from rounded yearly margins, so they can differ from the published scores in the last digit.', \
                'The basic tests (revenue, years of data, growth) and the five-year cost window cannot be moved here. The', \
